From: RIDI Paper Pro Android 8 bring-up
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: RIDI reader settings, front light and Wi-Fi screens
Apply from the Android source root:
  patch -p1 < device/ridi/e70q10/patches/0012-settings-reader-ui.patch
